WEBVTT

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:09.230
Hold it!

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:32.700
How are you feeling?

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:36.480
Much better. It's oh so warm.

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:40.360
What is this?

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:42.580
It's a special bio-liquid.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:46.130
It contains components similar to those 
that allow for internal regeneration.

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:46.720
Oh!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:51.100
I know this is a difficult condition for slimes, 
who have a hard time retaining their form,

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.220
but let's take our time to treat it.

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:56.370
Thank you very much, Doctor.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.080
Have a wonderful day.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:08.850
Take care.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:13.450
Looks like it worked great.

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:16.840
The bio-liquid seems to have been 
a perfect match with the patient.

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:21.070
To think that you'd use hot spring therapy 
to inspire you... I'm impressed, Dr. Glenn.

00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:23.350
I couldn't have done it without 
your knowledge, Sapphee.

00:01:34.170 --> 00:01:35.390
Come in.

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:42.780
Wait, you're...

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:46.180
Lindworm City Council Representative...

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:49.380
Lady Skadi Dragenfelt?

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:03.220
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:25.930
Case 3        The Flesh Golem Who Hates Doctors

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:27.520
<i>Lindworm is overall a fairly new city 
that began its development</i>

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:29.990
<i>after the war between humans 
and monsters ended.</i>

00:03:29.990 --> 00:03:34.860
<i>There's no other city where humans and 
monsters interact with each other as much.</i>

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:38.660
<i>And it's said that a city that prospers 
this much in a matter of ten years</i>

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.360
<i>is rather unprecedented.</i>

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:44.330
<i>The leading figure behind this development 
is a member of the rare dragon race,</i>

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:48.110
<i>as well as a city council 
representative, Skadi Dragenfelt.</i>

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:52.400
<i>This city would not have prospered 
were it not for her efforts.</i>

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:56.320
<i>In both name and substance, she is indeed 
this city's most powerful person.</i>

00:03:57.950 --> 00:04:01.380
Uh... What brings you 
here today, Lady Skadi?

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.750
May we help you with something?

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:15.760
Lady Draconness is asking 
if this is the Litbeit Clinic.

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:17.770
Y-Yes, it is...

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:24.190
I am Kunai Zenow.

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:27.040
I am Lady Draconness's 
attendant and bodyguard.

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:28.980
I see...

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:31.790
I shall relay Lady 
Draconness's words to you.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:35.270
You should be honored to hear her wisdom.

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:37.040
Show some respect and rejoice.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:43.900
I have heard rumors that Lady Skadi's 
bodyguard is excessively devoted to her.

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.750
You there! Silence!

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:51.850
Listen well. "My bodyguard has lost 
her right arm battling bandits,

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:54.530
and we are uncertain of 
where the arm is now."

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:56.550
"My bodyguard"... That would mean...

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:58.560
You're talking about yourself, right?

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.030
This is oddly complicated.

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:02.290
"Thus I would like you to locate the arm

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:05.040
and use your suturing skills 
to reattach it, Dr. Glenn,"

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.020
is what she is saying.

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:07.670
Do you understand?

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:10.650
So there was a battle?

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:14.330
"She successfully chased down some 
slavers we had been pursuing,

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.660
but fell into their trap.

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:19.160
Kunai took on ten of them before retreating,

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:21.700
but she dropped her arm somewhere."

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:24.660
I am so terribly sorry, Lady Draconness!

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:31.170
I think I understand the situation now. 
May I ask you some questions?

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:33.910
"You may ask anything," she says.

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:36.930
But do not assume you can ask 
anything you please, physician.

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:39.530
Know your place!

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:41.850
First, why did you come to my clinic?

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:46.320
I hear that Lady Skadi is quite 
close to my mentor, Dr. Cthulhy.

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:50.470
Wouldn't you have been better off 
going to the Central Hospital?

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:52.580
"I went, but she denied me immediately.

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:56.580
She told me that one of her most 
reliable students had his own clinic,

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:58.970
so I should go there."

00:05:58.970 --> 00:06:01.130
Right. So she's being difficult again.

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:02.580
Curse that octo-woman.

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:06.830
I'll need to know this for the exam. 
What kind of monster are you, Miss Kunai?

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:11.410
From the looks of it, you don't 
seem like a zombie or a ghoul.

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:17.680
"Kunai is not a monster. 
She is originally human."

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:23.380
"She is a flesh golem, 
made from parts of human corpses.

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:26.950
I hear that she was the experiment of a 
rather ambitious doctor from the Far East."

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:28.380
An experiment?

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:32.350
So they tried to create life?

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:35.620
"For that reason...

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:41.860
Kunai despises doctors."

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:47.570
I have no interest in accepting 
your services, physician.

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:50.980
She's awfully aggressive.

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:55.700
Yet she looked like a little lost puppy 
the moment Lady Skadi left...

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:57.320
I can hear you, Miss Saphentite!

00:06:57.320 --> 00:06:59.650
If I may, things dealing with the occult,

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:03.560
such as a golem, are outside 
of Dr. Glenn's expertise.

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:07.570
We only conduct scientific examinations 
based on clinical tests and observations.

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.580
Are you all right with that?

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:11.280
I'm not expecting much to begin with.

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:15.410
All Lady Draconness wants from you is 
your ability to suture my arm back on.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.330
But...

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.720
As I've said time and time 
again, I do not trust doctors.

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:21.080
I don't want your help.

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:25.230
I understand how you feel, but this 
is a request from Lady Skadi.

00:07:25.230 --> 00:07:27.930
I'd like you to help me find your 
right arm so we can reattach—

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:29.840
And I'm telling you that 
I don't need your help.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:31.620
I'll find my arm myself.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:34.230
Since I have my other arm,
I'll be able to reattach it myself.

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:38.070
Lady Draconness should be 
far enough away by now.

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:41.580
Sorry to waste your time.

00:07:57.270 --> 00:07:59.280
Unbelievable.

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:00.980
Her arm probably fell off because she

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:03.670
has the nerve to say she 
could reattach it with one arm.

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:07.330
From the looks of it, all of her 
other stitches were quite sloppy.

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:10.740
Yes. It appears as though the 
doctor who created Miss Kunai

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:14.370
was rather troubled, both mentally 
and in terms of technique.

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:17.580
Are you saying that justifies 
her hatred for doctors?

00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:20.090
Well, regardless of whether 
she hates doctors or not,

00:08:20.090 --> 00:08:23.200
it's my job to make sure that 
any patient gets better.

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:24.510
I'm going to head out.

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:26.250
Do you have an idea of 
where her right arm is?

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.380
Of course not.

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:29.390
I'm just going to look around everywhere.

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:31.730
Sorry, but I'll need you to handle
the afternoon appointments.

00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:35.780
Leave it to me. We do have 
very reliable fairies, after all.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:36.580
Leave it to us!

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:37.350
I'll help!

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:38.250
I'll do my best!

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:45.960
I lost him... I could've sworn 
he was one of those bandits...

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:54.630
I know I said I'd look around,

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:57.120
but it's not like I had a single clue.

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:00.940
I should've at least asked 
where she fought them.

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:05.450
She's probably just going 
to yell at me again,

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:08.720
but it'll be quicker to look 
around with Miss Kunai.

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:16.640
Miss Tisalia!

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:18.220
Doctor!

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:22.560
What in the world happened?

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:23.370
I-I...

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:24.960
Look over there!

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:26.460
Oh.

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:30.560
I-I thought I'd go shopping 
for some vegetables

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:33.220
and came without Kay and Lorna,

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:34.890
but then I found <i>that</i>!

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:46.710
It's been cut along her thigh muscle... 
No, this cut is old.

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:49.220
Her stitches must've ripped 
due to a strong impact.

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:51.190
H-How can you be so calm?

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:53.950
There's clearly been a murder! 
We must call the patrols at once!

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:58.440
This isn't a murder case. 
This is just Miss Kunai's leg.

00:09:58.440 --> 00:09:59.900
Kunai...?

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:03.950
You mean Kunai Zenow?

00:10:04.310 --> 00:10:05.860
You know her?

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.960
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.930
I was too careless...

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:19.800
To think I'd lose not only my 
arm, but my leg, as well...

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:27.970
I need to find them and 
get back to work at once,

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:30.530
or I'll never be able to face 
Lady Draconness again.

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:35.770
But it's not like I can ask 
for anyone's help now.

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:37.250
What should I do?

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:47.190
Wh-Who in the world is feeling up my leg?

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:52.130
S-Stop stroking that spot so carefully!

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:54.610
Who is... Stop!

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:59.530
Kunai Zenow is a former fighter who holds 
the record for the most consecutive wins

00:10:59.530 --> 00:11:01.130
in the arena's first rank.

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:05.970
Her accomplishments were recognized, and 
she was appointed as Lady Skadi's bodyguard.

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:08.850
It's hard to believe someone 
like her could be defeated.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:11.280
She might've been caught off her guard.

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:13.500
She was already missing her right arm.

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:17.180
And from the looks of this, 
her stitches were badly degraded.

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:21.000
Doctor, should you be touching that?

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:23.250
Observation is something 
every doctor needs to do.

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:26.160
I guess it still moves, 
even though it's been separated.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:30.450
I wonder if her parts aren't actually 
dead, and have a will of their own.

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:32.460
How are you so calm?

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:33.930
It's just part of my job.

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:39.710
While I was at the academy, I studied many 
bodies, both monsters and humans alike.

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:42.800
I've always known there are some 
peculiar folk who live in this city,

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:45.440
but you may be on another level, Doctor.

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:50.320
I-I'm sorry. I just get so focused 
when it comes to my work.

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:52.790
It's quite all right. I think 
I've fallen for you again.

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:53.550
It's just...

00:11:53.550 --> 00:11:54.060
Yes?

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:57.060
The way you keep fondling her leg like that,

00:11:57.060 --> 00:12:00.640
you almost seem like a disturbed 
pervert, Good Doctor.

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:06.230
Please make sure you don't 
ever mention that to Sapphee.

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:12.280
Damn it... It must be that physician.

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:15.750
How dare he keep touching my leg like that?

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:21.040
To think I can clearly feel it even 
though it's been separated from me...

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:24.810
This is some curse I've been dealt.

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:28.010
If it was just the sensation, 
it'd be one thing,

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:32.110
but even the voices of the corpses that 
make up my body resonate within me.

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:40.950
I want to serve a worthy master... 
I want to protect them.

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:41.880
I want them to acknowledge me...

00:12:41.470 --> 00:12:44.580
I want to fall in love again!

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:50.360
Stop it! You're too loud. Just be quiet!

00:12:56.440 --> 00:13:00.710
Now I just need to find her right arm, 
as well as Miss Kunai herself.

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:04.460
She really shouldn't be able 
to go that far in her state...

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:06.240
I wonder if she's nearby.

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:11.220
Hey! There you are, Dr. Glenn!

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:13.820
Lulala! What brings you here?

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:16.170
People are saying the 
craziest things about you!

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:20.480
They're saying you're gathering body 
parts to conduct some crazy experiment!

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:21.590
Everyone in town's saying it!

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:26.070
Yeah... I guess I can't blame 
people for thinking that.

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:29.050
But this is actually my patient's leg.

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:31.160
I know! It's Miss Kunai's, right?

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:37.370
There's actually something 
I wanted to give you!

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:40.280
Ta-da!

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:44.450
My arm suddenly feels different?

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:48.940
Is something rubbing against it? 
H-Hey! Be gentler...

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:55.300
I found it in the waterways earlier.

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:59.170
So many people have been throwing 
garbage into the waterways lately!

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:00.820
Seriously, they'll dump anything!

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:04.920
That is indeed a problem, 
but Miss Kunai's arm is not garbage.

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:05.940
I know!

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:09.440
There, now. All that's left 
is to find Miss Kunai.

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:14.780
Why don't you just ask her body?

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:16.140
Her body?

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:19.380
Hey, Arm and Leg, where's Miss Kunai?

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:27.800
I guess it never hurts to try.

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:28.250
Right?

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:41.390
I told you...

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:44.300
I keep telling you to stop touching me...

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:45.950
Curse you, physician...

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.270
I've been looking for you, Miss Kunai.

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:52.280
Physician...

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:54.580
I've found your arm and leg.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.920
I'll reattach them immediately.

00:14:57.280 --> 00:14:59.660
I don't need help from you!

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:01.160
Don't touch me!

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:04.560
I'm afraid I've already 
touched you quite a bit...

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:16.220
What do you intend to do with those hooks?

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:18.010
Aren't you going to suture my leg?

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:19.830
This is a suture needle.

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:23.020
This is the size needed to 
suture blood vessels together.

00:15:23.390 --> 00:15:26.200
Did you think I was going 
to use a sewing needle?

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:31.380
Seeing your old stitches made me realize

00:15:31.380 --> 00:15:35.620
that the person who created you 
was anything but a doctor.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:37.880
That doesn't matter.

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:40.660
More importantly, what do you mean by 
suturing my blood vessels together?

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:42.890
I'm going to connect your blood 
vessels and your nerves.

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:45.900
It appears that your tissue isn't dead,

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:48.500
so we can reconnect a 
lot of your blood vessels.

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:52.880
Though, since you lack metabolism, 
I'll need to leave in the sutures...

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:56.860
That's not necessary! Just sew 
my muscles back together!

00:15:56.860 --> 00:15:58.570
I'm a flesh golem!

00:15:58.570 --> 00:16:01.490
This body moves differently 
than one that's alive.

00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:03.250
I don't need any of this!

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:04.650
Do you really think that?

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:10.260
I'm not sure what makes 
flesh golems move,

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:13.780
but we mustn't be so negligent 
about how your body is connected.

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:15.930
If we don't connect your body properly,

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:18.280
these parts will continue 
to belong to someone else.

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:21.120
Someone else?

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:31.830
This may be a bit late to ask, but I'm 
assuming you won't need anesthesia.

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:34.520
I don't sense pain. Proceed.

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:49.070
Apparently, the way my name 
is written in the Far East

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:50.710
means "no suffering."

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:54.300
I'm aware of that. 
I'm also from the Far East.

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:58.950
My name, "Glenn," comes from "Guren," 
which means a crimson lotus flower.

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:00.380
I see.

00:17:02.340 --> 00:17:07.860
My creator told me I was a perfect human 
that would experience no suffering.

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:10.470
Since I could not feel pain, 
I could not suffer.

00:17:10.470 --> 00:17:13.500
That's why, physician... no, Dr. Glenn...

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:15.670
You don't need to be so delicate...

00:17:15.670 --> 00:17:17.340
That takes care of your blood vessels.

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:19.970
Next, let's reconnect your nerves.

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:21.910
Why would you go so far?

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:23.380
I'm a doctor.

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:26.430
It's my job to do everything 
I can for my patients.

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:28.990
Besides, someone who knows no suffering

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:31.450
wouldn't look like they're 
suffering the way you do.

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:38.650
This is something my mentor, 
Dr. Cthulhy, used to say:

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:41.410
"The fact that you suffer 
means that you're alive."

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:45.740
You're alive, Miss Kunai.

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:48.650
It's a doctor's job to try to ease the suffering

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:51.500
that we face because we're alive, 
even if only a tiny bit.

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:53.610
I can't get rid of all of it.

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:55.500
I can only lessen it.

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:57.170
I see.

00:17:58.200 --> 00:18:00.630
I never knew there were doctors like you.

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:05.530
I'd like to think that 
I'm not in the minority.

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:18.960
How does that feel?

00:18:22.150 --> 00:18:25.100
Good. It's better than it's ever been before.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.160
Well done, Dr. Glenn.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:29.470
Next, I'll work on your left leg.

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:31.630
I should be done with that 
before the sun goes down.

00:18:32.030 --> 00:18:33.630
I-Is that so?

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:35.130
All right...

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:41.680
What a shame...

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:44.440
The good doctor's not in today?

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:51.330
I came all the way to this clinic so I could 
see this Dr. Glenn you keep talking about.

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:53.810
How very unfortunate.

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:56.670
Oh, don't be so cruel. 
We're drinking buddies.

00:18:56.670 --> 00:18:58.800
Bring him to the pub next time.

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:01.420
Absolutely not. The doctor's busy.

00:19:01.420 --> 00:19:03.320
But I gave you a gift.

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:07.690
You also said you just found it somewhere. 
And then you forced me to take it.

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:11.940
Well, whatever. 
I guess I'll head home for the day.

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:13.300
Give the good doctor my regards.

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:15.430
Fine. See you at the pub.

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:22.840
I wonder if sweet li'l Dr. Glenn's cheating 
on you somewhere right about now.

00:19:35.990 --> 00:19:40.410
I'm sorry to ask this, Miss Kunai, but could 
you lift up your skirt a little more?

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:42.260
F-Fine!

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:45.600
I'll finish this as quickly as possible.

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:46.790
R-Right.

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:48.490
Does that hurt?

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:50.920
I-It's just a bit cold. Just continue!

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:52.260
But your arm was fine...

00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:54.660
H-How am I supposed to know?

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:56.870
My creator made me like this!

00:19:57.430 --> 00:20:01.210
They clearly had a lot of issues.

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:07.680
C-Can't you do something about this?!

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:10.010
Making me moan like this...

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:18.190
Say something, you quack! How are you 
not reacting to me sounding like this—

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:20.240
Actually, I'd rather you didn't react—

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:26.210
You won't get away with this!

00:20:26.210 --> 00:20:29.650
Once the surgery's over, 
I'm going to... I'm going to—

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:46.110
This is exactly why I despise doctors!

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:49.100
Just so you know, I'll never 
forget this humiliation!

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:53.930
But out of respect for Lady Draconness, 
I'll save your punishment for later.

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:54.840
Thanks...

00:20:58.180 --> 00:20:59.360
But still...

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:01.130
You truly saved me.

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:02.900
I thank you, Dr. Glenn.

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:04.050
Farewell!

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:23.650
I'm back.

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.060
Welcome home.

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:25.880
Welcome home.

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:27.130
Where's our milk?

00:21:27.130 --> 00:21:28.770
Oh, sorry. I'll get you some right now.

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:35.570
Here's your milk for the day.

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:36.970
Yay!

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:41.650
I wonder if Sapphee went out for the night.

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:44.520
I'm right here, Dr. Glenn.

00:21:48.420 --> 00:21:49.670
Sapphee?

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:52.760
Please look, Doctor.

00:21:57.100 --> 00:22:01.160
It appears that I've become pregnant.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.970
Case 4         The Lamia With an Incurable Disease

00:23:35.590 --> 00:23:39.480
Case 4: "The Lamia With an Incurable Disease."
